{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QMwnaFfRmm1795054996.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>APEC第三十三次領導人非正式會議今日開幕，國家主席習近平將發表講話。</p><p></p><p>在舉行會議的深圳香蜜湖主場館國際交流中心外，多個出入口都有保安人員駐守，附近亦有警員巡邏，周邊路段實行分時段臨時交通管制措施。</p><p></p><p>早上近九時，有車隊陸續駛入會場範圍。APEC領導人非正式會議上午開幕，習近平將發表講話。外交部早前表示，期待達成《深圳宣言》。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.572073+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:33.939269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:56.137260+00:00","content_hash":"096f1ef8dcbcbcc01869aef6d68ab72ee35b7f17cb492b8625a88c496e414781","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.572073+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}